    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Alpha Research - Thesis Synthesis + News Intelligence + HITL Approval\n\n**Workflow 2 of 2** | Pipelines 3 + 4 + 5\n\nThree interconnected pipelines: (1) Thesis synthesis from new analysis files, (2) Daily news monitoring with relevance scoring, (3) Human-in-the-loop email approval before any file modification.\n\n**Setup:** Add Google Drive + Anthropic + Email (SMTP) credentials. Configure API keys for Tavily, AlphaVantage, SerpAPI in respective HTTP Request nodes.\n\n**HITL:** Approval emails include signed Approve/Reject buttons. 7-day timeout. Nothing modifies files without explicit human approval.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 2100,
        "color": 4
      },
